<title>EGYPT: Egyptian Gulf Bank profit up in Q3.</title>
<headline>Egyptian Gulf Bank profit up in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first nine months of</p>
<p>1996.</p>
<p>	   (million Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>				 1996		1995</p>
<p> Net profit		    14.8	     11.9</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity     127		 82</p>
<p> Assets		     1,177.3	  1,002.1</p>
<p> Total deposits	     909.3	    523.6</p>
<p>Full Name: Egyptian Gulf Bank.</p>
<p>Note - Egyptian Gulf Bank is a commercial investment bank.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
